<title>COMOROS: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>COMOROS GOVERNMENT LIST (970102)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> *  2 Jan 97 - President Taki appointed a new 11-member	*</p>
<p> *		 government under Prime Minister Abdou.	  *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> President........................................Mohamed TAKI</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 2 Jan 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 27 Dec 96)..................Ahmed ABDOU</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>Administrative Reform, Decentralisation, Employment and</p>
<p>     Relations with Federal Assembly.........Nidhoim ATTOUMANE</p>
<p>Agricultural Production, Marine Resources and</p>
<p>     Environment.............................Issamidine ADAINE</p>
<p>Economy, Finance, Budget and Home Trade...Mohamed Ali SOILIHI</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs, Cooperation, Foreign Trade and</p>
<p>     Francophony..........................Mountar Ahmed CHARIF</p>
<p>Industry, Mining Research, Craft Industries and</p>
<p>     Energy..............................Daniel Said ATTOUMANE</p>
<p> Interior and Information.................Achirafi Said HACHIM</p>
<p>Lord Chancellor, Justice and Penitentiary</p>
<p>     Administration.............................Harimiya AHMED</p>
<p>National Education, Culture, Vocational Training, Scientific</p>
<p>     Research, Youth and Sports.........Abdoulhamid AFFRAITANE</p>
<p> Public Health and Population................Hourdine BOURMANE</p>
<p>Territory Development, Town Planning and</p>
<p>     Housing.................................Mouzaoir ABDALLAH</p>
<p>Transport, Tourism, Posts and</p>
<p>     Telecommunications.........................Ibrahim HALIDI</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End Government List)</p>
</text>
